            "image": "shopify://shop_images/1950.jpg",
            "sub_title": "1950s",
            "title": "Full Steam Ahead",
            "text": "<p>Morphy Richards as a public company merged with Astral and registered a turnover of over £5.5 million with irons as its major product.</p>",
